  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi></math> be the three distinct positive real numbers such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></math> is equal to ______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given equation:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi></math>&nbsp;........(i)</p><p>Similarly, from second equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;......(ii)</p><p>Substitute&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math>,</p><p>We get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>But&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mi>c</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required answer.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}